From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Mark Harfouche <mark.harfouche@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 22 Mar 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 33/33] Vendor gRPC 1.68.2 bazel/ for TF_SYSTEM_LIBS gRPC

When com_github_grpc_grpc uses system_build_file, Bazel still loads Starlark
from @com_github_grpc_grpc//bazel/*. Symlink the upstream gRPC 1.68.2 bazel
tree (matching workspace2) into the external repo; grpc_deps.bzl and
grpc_extra_deps.bzl are no-ops so workspace hooks do not fetch deps.
---

